Version 4
SymbolType BLOCK
LINE Normal -1 16 -16 16
LINE Normal -1 16 16 16
CIRCLE Normal 3 20 -5 12
SYMATTR Prefix X
SYMATTR SpiceModel ameter
SYMATTR ModelFile measure.lib
SYMATTR Value att=1000 f=50  tripdt=1u  tripdv=100  off=1mv  tripdt2=10n
SYMATTR Description current RMS meter for L3
PIN -16 16 NONE 8
PINATTR PinName IN1
PINATTR SpiceOrder 1
PIN 16 16 NONE 8
PINATTR PinName OUT1
PINATTR SpiceOrder 2
PIN 16 -32 NONE 8
PINATTR PinName M_I
PINATTR SpiceOrder 3
